Balance at k=5 (25.9M nodes) and k=6 (117.3M nodes), max-shard share and the resulting ceiling:
  k=5  N=8  D2=1   64.0% -> 1.56x        k=6  N=8  D2=1   67.9% -> 1.47x
  k=5  N=8  D2=2   35.7% -> 2.80x        k=6  N=64 D2=16  12.6% -> 7.94x
  k=5  N=8  D2=4   25.3% -> 3.96x
